<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Central Bank credit to govt up in June.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Central Bank credit to govt up in June.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's Central Bank said in its weekly economic report on Monday that net credit to the government rose 37.4 percent to 57.9 billion rupees in June 1997 over the same period last year.</p>
<p>It said credit to the private sector was up 4.6 percent year-on-year at 203.4 billion rupees.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
